        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Solvability and complexity tell us whether a problem can be solved by an algorithm and, if so, how efficiently. This section distinguishes solvable from unsolvable problems and tractable from intractable ones, laying a foundation for computational complexity."
          }
